{"speciesId":880,"names":{"fr":"Galvagon","es":"Dracozolt","en":"Dracozolt","ja":"パッチラゴン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Jadis, la partie inférieure de son corps musclé le rendait invincible, mais il s’est éteint après avoir mangé toutes les plantes dont il se nourrissait."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"La robustez de su tren inferior lo hacía invencible en la antigüedad, pero se extinguió tras comerse todas las plantas de las que se nutría."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"In ancient times, it was unbeatable thanks to its powerful lower body, but it went extinct anyway after it depleted all its plant-based food sources."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"古代では たくましい 下半身で 無敵だったが 餌の 植物を 食べつくしてしまい 絶滅した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il envoie des décharges avec les muscles puissants de sa queue. La partie supérieure de son corps est trop petite par rapport à la partie inférieure."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Produce electricidad con la robusta musculatura de la cola. El tamaño de la parte superior del cuerpo palidece en comparación con la inferior."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The powerful muscles in its tail generate its electricity. Compared to its lower body, its upper half is entirely too small."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"しっぽの たくましい 筋肉で 発電する。 下半身に くらべ 上半身が 小さすぎる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":880,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",49]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[20,"level-up",42]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-spin","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name